      "rationale": "Subtrahends range from 1 up to 9 and cases that cross a ten are present alongside ones that do not: 93 minus 9 and 58 minus 9 both break a ten, while 75 minus 1 and 24 minus 1 stay inside it. Both halves of the inverse pairing are also shown, since seed 502 supplies the addition as a hint rather than as the premise."
    },
    "cognitive_capacity": {
